OL,3,GNEWSASeven arrests in police crackdown
OL,4,Aon Glasgow city centre disorder
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have arrested seven people in 12
OL,7,Fhours as part of a crackdown on
OL,8,Fviolence, disorder and anti-social
OL,9,Fbehaviour in Glasgow city centre.
OL,11,FFour men and three women were involved
OL,12,Fin alleged assaults, weapons offences,
OL,13,Fand breach of the peace between 14:20
OL,14,Fon Tuesday and 02:20 on Wednesday.
OL,16,FThe force said it was committed to
OL,17,Fensuring the city centre was a "safe
OL,18,Fand welcoming place for everyone".
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
